Appendix: Common Issues & Solutions
Issue: Model memorizes training data
Solution: Reduce latent_dim, add dropout, increase regularization
Issue: Too many false positives
Solution: Increase threshold_percentile, increase latent_dim
Issue: Missing obvious anomalies
Solution: Decrease threshold_percentile, reduce latent_dim
Issue: Training is slow
Solution: Use GPU, reduce chip_size, increase batch_size
Issue: Out of memory errors
Solution: Reduce batch_size, reduce chip_size, use gradient checkpointing
Issue: Poor reconstruction quality
Solution: Increase num_epochs, reduce learning_rate, add batch normalization

